                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "235126091",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198051796703",
                            "num_reviews": 1,
                            "playtime_forever": 205,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 205,
                            "last_played": 1658796305
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "TLDR: This game made an avid kite flyer out of me.\n\nI bought this game for under 2$ during a sale, like 3-4 years ago. I did not know what I was expecting as I did not know dual-lines kites were a thing at the time. I played for a bit and I got hooked. It's impossible to do stunt tricks and It is very basic (pull left to turn left, pull right to turn right) but it got me curious about stunt kites, I thought it was really fun to be able to control where the kite flies in the sky. \n\nI did a bit of research and since then, I bought two different dual-line kites and I feel like what I \"learned\" in about 4h of gameplay translated to the real world almost perfectly. I was able to keep the kite in the air for many minutes, the first time I ever launched one. I also recently bought a quad-line kite. This game created a new passion for me, so watch out, it may end costing you more than a few bucks in the end!",
